WEBVTT

NOTE
Ultimecia's Castle revealed against the moon.
Duration: approximately 19 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Out of dark, moonlit clouds rises Ultimecia's Castle.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.200
A gothic fortress of spires set upon an enormous clawed black structure.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.480
It stands against a huge pale moon.
